    {
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "If the stray worktree is ever cleaned up (\u0060git worktree remove .claude/worktrees/agent-a0edb32f3c9d18d20\u0060), the default out-of-process toolchain would work again, but there\u0027s no need to revert MonitoringInProcessConfig \u2014 in-process execution is also the correct choice for any benchmark whose IterationSetup/IterationCleanup mutate real state (RunStrategy.Monitoring requires exactly one invocation per iteration, which in-process honors identically to out-of-process).",
